    {
      "id": "02",
      "segment": 1,
      "beat": "flower-in-hands",
      "narration": "Her friend named her Thumbelina and carefully held the blossom in two gentle hands. To Thumbelina, every petal was a soft curtain, and every drop of dew was a shining little world.",
